; Zone Bodycam - small 1x1 inventory icons for the five Axon Body cameras (optional FOMOD component, needs the
; bodycam item component). DLTX patch for the sections in items\items\items_zbc_bodycam.ltx (needs modded exes;
; GAMMA has them). Atlas: textures\ui\ui_icon_zbc_bodycam_1x1.dds, 256x64, one 50x50 cell per camera, built by
; tools\bodycam_item\make_item_textures.py --atlas-1x1. Every key is set on every section: the children carry
; their own inv_grid_x and must not depend on what they inherit from [zbc_bodycam_item].

